Package: forexdatasets
Title: Fetch, Store and Serve Forex Price Data and C.O.T report
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lekgoa", "Komane", , "lionel.komane@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Keeps forex price data (H1, H4, daily, weekly, monthly and
    quarterly) and cot_report as parquet files, one file per ticker, and
    serves it quickly to other packages. For personal use.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
